OL,3,GNEWSABoy's love of farming inspires
OL,4,Atractor fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old boy who "loves anything
OL,7,Fto do with farming" has raised more
OL,8,Fthan #1,000 for a rural mental health
OL,9,Fcharity by organising a tractor run.
OL,11,FDexter, from Wingfield in Suffolk, who
OL,12,Fwould be a sixth-generation farmer,
OL,13,Fsaid he wanted to help "a different
OL,14,Fcharity" than most people and drew on
OL,15,Fhis love of tractors as inspiration.
OL,17,FThe event raised money for the East of
OL,18,FEngland-based You Are Not Alone (YANA)
OL,19,Fcharity which was founded by a group of
OL,20,Ffarmers from Norfolk.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
