OL,3,GNEWSABoy's love of farming inspires
OL,4,Atractor fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FDexter said it made him feel "really
OL,7,Fhappy and great" and he was glad so
OL,8,Fmany people had turned up for the run,
OL,9,Fwhich went from Suffolk into Norfolk.
